OL,5,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,6,     FGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,7,     Fclassical music, with discoveries
OL,8,     Fand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,9,     Fwith familiar favourites.
OL,10,G1300 Classical Live
OL,11,     FMark Forrest introduces an
OL,12,     Fafternoon of specially made
OL,13,     Frecordings of orchestral music
OL,14,     Ffrom the Royal Philharmonic
OL,15,     FOrchestra and chamber performances
OL,16,     Ffrom the St. Magnus Festival.
OL,17,G1600 Composer of the Week: Barber
OL,18,     F2/5. Donald Macleod explores a
OL,19,     Fperiod in Barber's life when he
OL,20,     Fcomposed his iconic Piano Sonata.
